<title>USA: CBOE to list Teledata Communications options.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list Teledata Communications options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Thursday it will begin trading options on Teledata Communications Ltd on July 16.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options will open with strike prices of 30, 35 and 40 and initial expirations in August, September, October and January.</p>
<p>Kessler Asher Securities Trading LP will be the Designated Primary Market Maker (DPM) in the options.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
